Z||000008||Formula88||03-27-2001||10:01 PM||||I love the idea of a Northstar converstion!  V8, 32 valve - it's got Fiero written all over it!  My only gripe is no 5-speed.  At least, I can't imagine a Getrag that wouldn't grenade behind that engine!  The only thing worse than not having a powerful car, would be having a powerful car you couldn't drive the hell out of for fear of breaking something.  Now, if I can figure out how to get a stick shift (and clutch!) to hold up behind a N*, then that's going on my long term to do list.  Probably for an F355 rebody.  Man, I'd love to see that baby in person!  Daytona Beach, top down, N* Fiero, man life's ruff!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
